9.5 Multiple shocks and mixed swaps
Multiple uniform shocks of different scope can be combined in a list and passed to ems_deploy(). Swaps can also be mixed, combining partial ems_swap() objects with full variable strings (GTAPv6 sets in this example):
partial &lt;- ems_uniform_shock(
  var = "qfd",
  value = -1,
  REGs = "usa",
  PROD_COMMj = "crops"
)

full &lt;- ems_uniform_shock(
  var = "yp",
  value = 0.1
)

qfd &lt;- ems_swap(
  var = "qfd",
  REGs = "usa",
  PROD_COMMj = "crops"
)

tfd &lt;- ems_swap(
  var = "tfd",
  REGr = "usa",
  PROD_COMMj = "crops"
)

cmf_path &lt;- ems_deploy(
  .data = dat,
  model = model,
  shock = list(partial, full),
  swap_in = list(qfd, "yp"),
  swap_out = list(tfd, "dppriv")
)
